  "name": "Chicken Cacciatore with Rice",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken and peppers in a seasoned tomato sauce over quick-cooking rice.",
  "description": "A simple Italian-inspired skillet meal combining chicken, aromatics, peppers, and tomatoes with instant rice.",
